'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 14''' was the fourteenth show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on October 1, 2026 at the Anjo-Saikawa Municipal Gymnasium in [[Anjo-Saikawa]]. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block B]] Round 7 matches.

The night is remembered for the block flipping upside down — [[Tadayoshi Ishida]], written off at 3-3, submitting the man who ended the 1,095-day reign — and for the top of the block scrambling into a four-man race with two rounds left.

